/T (Project Overview  Road Hero is a community-driven mobile application designed to improve road safety across urban and semi-urban environments. The application empowers ordinary citizens to actively participate in identifying, reporting, and monitoring road hazards in real-time. By combining advanced artificial intelligence with crowdsourced community action, Road Hero creates a comprehensive, self-sustaining safety network that connects drivers, pedestrians, and road authorities.The core philosophy of Road Hero is that safer roads are built not just by governments, but by informed and engaged communities. Every user becomes a "Road Hero" contributing to a living map of road conditions that benefits all travelers in their area. )
/E (Project Overview  Road Hero is a community-driven mobile application designed to improve road safety across urban and semi-urban environments. The application empowers ordinary citizens to actively participate in identifying, reporting, and monitoring road hazards in real-time. By combining advanced artificial intelligence with crowdsourced community action, Road Hero creates a comprehensive, self-sustaining safety network that connects drivers, pedestrians, and road authorities.The core philosophy of Road Hero is that safer roads are built not just by governments, but by informed and engaged communities. Every user becomes a "Road Hero" contributing to a living map of road conditions that benefits all travelers in their area. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
