/T (The map loadsusing GPS-integrated mapping and displays hazard pins at their exact GPS-logged locations.  Color-coded markers indicate hazard severity  users can quickly identify low, medium,  high, and critical hazards.  The map updates in real-time as new hazards are reported and as resolved hazards are  removed from the system.  Users can plan their routes with hazard awareness, avoiding dangerous areas and  accident-prone zones.  Only community-verified hazard locations appear with full detail; unverified reports  appear as provisional markers.  A 'Capture Hazard' shortcut button is accessible directly from the map screen. )
/E (The map loadsusing GPS-integrated mapping and displays hazard pins at their exact GPS-logged locations.  Color-coded markers indicate hazard severity  users can quickly identify low, medium,  high, and critical hazards.  The map updates in real-time as new hazards are reported and as resolved hazards are  removed from the system.  Users can plan their routes with hazard awareness, avoiding dangerous areas and  accident-prone zones.  Only community-verified hazard locations appear with full detail; unverified reports  appear as provisional markers.  A 'Capture Hazard' shortcut button is accessible directly from the map screen. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
