/T (ReportsTab:Displaysallhazard reports submitted platform-wide, with thumbnails, reporternames,AIdescriptions, dates, severity levels, and current status badges \(Reported/InProgress/Resolved\).  Adminscantapanyreporttoexpand full details  including the complete AI analysis in  both EnglishandBangla and update the hazard workflow status using three action  buttons:Reported,Progress,Resolved.  AgentsTab:Listsallregistered users with their email, XP, and rank. Admins can tap any user toviewtheircompleteprofile including phone number, gender, and point total, with an optiontodeletetheaccount if necessary.  All adminactionsareloggedand reflected in real-time across the entire platform through  Firestore's live sync.)
/E (ReportsTab:Displaysallhazard reports submitted platform-wide, with thumbnails, reporternames,AIdescriptions, dates, severity levels, and current status badges \(Reported/InProgress/Resolved\).  Adminscantapanyreporttoexpand full details  including the complete AI analysis in  both EnglishandBangla and update the hazard workflow status using three action  buttons:Reported,Progress,Resolved.  AgentsTab:Listsallregistered users with their email, XP, and rank. Admins can tap any user toviewtheircompleteprofile including phone number, gender, and point total, with an optiontodeletetheaccount if necessary.  All adminactionsareloggedand reflected in real-time across the entire platform through  Firestore's live sync.)
