/T (Conclusion  RoadHero demonstrates how modern mobile technology, artificial intelligence, and community engagement can be combined to address a critical public safety challenge. By putting the power of road hazard detection in the hands of every citizen, and reinforcing it with AI analysis and a structured verification system, Road Hero creates a self-improving safety network that benefits all road users.   )
/E (Conclusion  RoadHero demonstrates how modern mobile technology, artificial intelligence, and community engagement can be combined to address a critical public safety challenge. By putting the power of road hazard detection in the hands of every citizen, and reinforcing it with AI analysis and a structured verification system, Road Hero creates a self-improving safety network that benefits all road users.   )
