/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 88 0 R
/T (Government Integration: Direct API connection to municipal road maintenance systems, enabling automatic work order generation when hazards reach a defined severity threshold. This closes the loop between citizen reporting and official repair action.  Live Traffic Integration: Combining hazard data with real-time traffic flow information to  provide dynamic route optimization and congestion alerts, similar to Waze but focused  specifically on road damage.  Advanced AI Accuracy: Training custom road hazard detection models on locally collected Bangladeshi road condition datasets to improve classification accuracy beyond general-purpose vision models.  Smart Notification Routing: Proactive hazard alerts delivered based on the user's saved  routes and regular travel patterns, notifying them of new hazards along their commute  before they set out.  Web-Based Admin Dashboard: A full browser-based administrative interface with analytics charts, heatmaps, and export capabilities for government and municipal use. )
/E (Government Integration: Direct API connection to municipal road maintenance systems, enabling automatic work order generation when hazards reach a defined severity threshold. This closes the loop between citizen reporting and official repair action.  Live Traffic Integration: Combining hazard data with real-time traffic flow information to  provide dynamic route optimization and congestion alerts, similar to Waze but focused  specifically on road damage.  Advanced AI Accuracy: Training custom road hazard detection models on locally collected Bangladeshi road condition datasets to improve classification accuracy beyond general-purpose vision models.  Smart Notification Routing: Proactive hazard alerts delivered based on the user's saved  routes and regular travel patterns, notifying them of new hazards along their commute  before they set out.  Web-Based Admin Dashboard: A full browser-based administrative interface with analytics charts, heatmaps, and export capabilities for government and municipal use. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
