1102 0 obj
<<
/Title (Government Integration: Direct API connection to municipal road maintenance systems, enabling automatic work order generation when hazards reach a defined severity threshold. This closes the loop between citizen reporting and official repair action.  Live Traffic Integration: Combining hazard data with real-time traffic flow information to  provide dynamic route optimization and congestion alerts, similar to Waze but focused  specifically on road damage.  Advanced AI Accuracy: Training custom road hazard detection models on locally collected Bangladeshi road condition datasets to improve classification accuracy beyond general-purpose vision models.  Smart Notification Routing: Proactive hazard alerts delivered based on the user's saved  routes and regular travel patterns, notifying them of new hazards along their commute  before they set out.  Web-Based Admin Dashboard: A full browser-based administrative interface with analytics charts, heatmaps, and export capabilities for government and municipal use.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 28 0 R
/Prev 645 0 R
/Next 1216 0 R
>>
endobj
