1212 0 obj
<<
/Title (Poor road conditions cause thousands of accidents annually, putting drivers and pedestrians at serious risk of injury and property damage.  No real-time hazard reporting system exists for drivers to warn others about sudden road  dangers such as potholes, debris, or flooding.  Road damage tracking remains fragmented with no centralized platform connecting  citizens, authorities, and maintenance teams.  Citizens have no structured way to hold authorities accountable for unrepaired road  damage.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1098 0 R
/Next 1315 0 R
>>
endobj
