1214 0 obj
<<
/Title (Displays the user's profile photo, full name, email address, total reports filed,  accumulated XP, and current rank badge.  Edit Identity: Allows users to update their display name, profile photo, and other personal  details.  Mission History: Provides a complete log of all hazards the user has ever reported or  verified, with status indicators.  Privacy & Policy: Links to the application's privacy policy and usage terms.  App Settings: Access to notification preferences, theme customization, and device  interaction settings.  Safety Guidelines: Reference documentation for how to correctly identify and report  different types of road hazards.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1099 0 R
>>
endobj
