/Title (Conclusion  RoadHero demonstrates how modern mobile technology, artificial intelligence, and community engagement can be combined to address a critical public safety challenge. By putting the power of road hazard detection in the hands of every citizen, and reinforcing it with AI analysis and a structured verification system, Road Hero creates a self-improving safety network that benefits all road users.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 28 0 R
/Prev 1102 0 R
/Next 1217 0 R
