/Title (Private Ops:One-to-one private messaging between any two registered users for direct communicationaboutspecific hazards or safety concerns.  Sector Comms:Acommunity group chat where all users in the network can participate in  neighborhood-widediscussions and receive real-time hazard alerts.  Official HazardAlertcards are automatically injected into the group chat when high- severity hazardsarereported, including the damage type, severity level, and a 'View  Tactical Map'link. Firebase CloudMessaging powers instant notification delivery so users are alerted even  when the appisinthebackground.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1213 0 R
/Next 1318 0 R
