/Title (All hazard reports submitted to the system are queued in the Verification Hub for community review.  Community members who encounter the reported road location can cast a vote: 'Still  Broken' \(hazard persists\) or 'It's Fixed' \(hazard resolved\).  A progress indicator shows how many of the 3 required resolved votes have been  received \(e.g., '1/3 Verify Fix Progress'\).  When 3 resolved votes are collected from verified users, a Firebase Cloud Function  automatically updates the hazard status to 'Resolved' and removes it from the active  map and feed.  This crowdsourced validation model ensures only current, real hazards remain visible to  drivers.  Users earn XP for each verification vote they cast, regardless of the outcome.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1370 0 R
/Next 1380 0 R
>>
