/Title (The user opensthe AI Scanner screen and taps 'Capture Evidence' to take a photo or upload an existing image of the road damage.  The app automatically captures GPS coordinates and timestamps the submission.  On pressing 'AI Intelligence Scan', the image is encoded in Base64 and sent to the  Google Gemini 1.5 Flash API along with a structured prompt and location metadata.  The AI performs multimodal analysis and returns a hazard description including damage  type \(e.g., Severe Potholes, Alligator Cracking\) and severity rating \(Low / Medium / High  / Severe\).  The report is automatically posted to the Community Hub feed, pinned on the Safe Route Map, and added to the Verification Hub queue for community validation.  The submitting user earns points, contributing to their Community Board rank.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1398 0 R
/Next 1408 0 R
>>
endobj
